        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana WBC238, 2-3/8 Inch Solid Brass Convex Wall Door Stop</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 2-3/8\" round flush wall mounted door bumper is made of solid brass and available in 8 great finishes. Easy to install with the included hardware. The rubber bumper is convex (protrudes outward). It can be used anywhere from homes to schools to retail shopping malls to prevent damage from a door crashing into a wall. By mounting the door stop on the wall, and centering it where the door knob makes contact, you can protect both the wall and the knob.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-WBC238U-specifications.gif?v=1704354768\" width=\"367\" height=\"163\" border=\"0\" atl=\"2-3/8 Inch Convex Wall Door Stop Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana WBC238 2-3/8 Inch Wall Door Stop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/WBC238.pdf?v=1691095378\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana  WBC238 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "2-3/8 Inch Convex Door Bumper",
                "description": "2-3/8 Inch Solid Brass Convex Wall Door Stop, Deltana WBC238 - This 2-3/8 inch round flush wall mounted door bumper is made of solid brass and available in 8 great finishes. Easy to install with the included hardware. The rubber bumper is convex (protrudes outward). It can be used anywhere from homes to schools to retail shopping malls to prevent damage from a door crashing into a wall. By mounting the door stop on the wall, and centering it where the door knob makes contact, you can protect both the wall and the knob.",
